---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Freelance Calculators | MathMyRate" description="Rate planning for freelancers: establish a sustainable hourly floor, then carry it into a scoped project quote.">
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">Freelance pricing</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-4 max-w-3xl text-5xl font-bold leading-none md:text-6xl">Start with the work.<br />Then price it properly.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Use the annual tool to establish a sustainable floor. Carry that rate into a scoped project quote when you are ready.</p>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a href="/freelance/hourly-rate-calculator/" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-line bg-[#fafbfd] p-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Capacity</p><h2 class="display mt-5 text-3xl font-bold">Hourly &amp; day rate</h2><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Calculate the annual revenue, hourly floor, and day rate required for your working year.</p><span class="mt-8 block font-semibold text-navy">Calculate my rate →</span></a>
      <a href="/freelance/project-rate-calculator/" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-line bg-[#fafbfd] p-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Scope</p><h2 class="display mt-5 text-3xl font-bold">Project quote</h2><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Calculate labor, contingency, reimbursable expenses, and a clear receipt target.</p><span class="mt-8 block font-semibold text-gold">Build a quote →</span></a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>